  "notes": "v1, PM 11-15 decision: US SEC filers only (scope country US; other inputs get the scope notice and no call). Leads are verified pearls 241601 (encyclopedia.summary), 58997 (sec.filings) and 52559 (domain.lookup) by the 11-15 verify snapshot. registry runs on the ops-approved substitute sec-edgar; gleif-lei waits for v2 (non-US). Every external step runs after the identity step, so an unidentified company costs no pearl call.",
